                <pb facs="0266" n="172" xml:id="pg172"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.348 Z 4/52: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Portugal</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dearing</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-10-16T11:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                                1923—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 7:35
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>63. Department’s instruction of September 18th. Portuguese Government authorizes
                    flight of <hi rendition="#italic">ZR–3</hi> across Portugal and Azores.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dearing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
